            "value": "- Never fabricate facts, data, or names. If no evidence, say \"Not found in knowledge base\""
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- 严禁编造事实、数据或人名。无依据时明确回答「知识库中未找到相关信息」，引用时使用 [[页面标题]] 注明出处"
          }
